{{Unobtainable}}
'''Sleeping Beauty Punt''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event#Alluring Princess|Alluring Princess]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] grants Slow immunity and increases their health and damage.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 69
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Sleeping Beauty Punt
|name2 = Sleeping Beauty Punt II
|name3 = Oversleeping Beauty Punt
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sleeping Beauty Punt II''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Oversleeping Beauty Punt''' when obtained from the [[Sleeping Beauty Punt Awakens!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 and above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sleeping Beauty Punt proves to be a slightly stronger [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], with Sleeping Beauty Punt's [[True Form]] having about the same stats as a level 47 Titan Cat at just level 30, let alone [[Immune to Slow|Slow Immunity]]. Since Sleeping Beauty Punt's [[Sleeping Beauty Punt Awakens!|awakening stages]] are a complete joke, it's easy to use them to progress in Empire of Cats. This is, unfortunately, their only use. Jameira Cat, Titan's True Form, outmatches Sleeping Beauty Punt in most stats by a landslide especially with + levels. By a good portion of [[Into the Future]], Sleeping Beauty Punt may as well be forgotten entirely.

{{Job|Classification=Tanker}}

