==Trivia==
*Sleeping Beauty Punt is currently the only Super Rare Cat that isn't unlocked from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]], [[Catnip Challenges]], a [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat stage]], an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent stage]] or a [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone stage]].
*Prior to the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event/2017 Collab|2017 Collab]], this Cat was unlocked by completing ''Battle Cats Challenge'' - Stage 1 in the Princess Punt Sweets app.

